msgstr "Configurazione {#setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the same Trotterized Ising circuit and observable as the [quickstart guide](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart).\n"
msgstr "Usa lo stesso circuito di Ising con Trotter e la stessa osservabile della [guida rapida](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart).\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "`draw_shaded_lightcone` {#draw_shaded_lightcone}"
msgstr "`draw_shaded_lightcone` {#draw_shaded_lightcone}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each noisy box is shaded by the bound on the errors occurring there: bright means a large bound, and\n"
"a box fading into the background means its errors have little effect on the observable. Those faded\n"
"boxes are the candidates for dropping from the mitigated noise model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ogni box rumoroso è ombreggiato in base al limite sugli errori che vi si verificano: luminoso significa un limite grande, e\n"
"un box che sfuma nello sfondo significa che i suoi errori hanno poco effetto sull'osservabile. Quei box\n"
"sfumati sono i candidati da eliminare dal modello di rumore mitigato.\n"

